        },
        {
          "text": "Nezitsha, nemicengezi yomlilo, nezitsha, nezinkezo, nezinti zezibani, nezinkezo, nezinkezo; okwakuyigolide elisegolide, nalokho okwakuyisiliva esiliva, induna yemilindankosi yakuthatha.",
