              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Izinsika, ukuphakama kwenye insika kwakuyizingalo eziyishumi nesishiyagalombili; umucu oyizingalo eziyishumi nambili wawuzungeza; uhlonze lwalo lwaluyiminwe emine; yayiyize.",
