              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wathatha nomthenwa emzini, owayephezu kwamadoda empi; namadoda ayisikhombisa ayeseceleni kwenkosi afunyanwa emzini; nombhali omkhulu wempi, owabutha abantu bezwe; namadoda angamashumi ayisithupha kubantu bezwe afunyanwa phakathi komuzi.",
          "type": "text",
