              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngokudla kwakhe waphiwa ukudla kwaphakade okuvela enkosini yaseBhabhiloni, ingxenye yansuku zonke kwaze kwaba lusuku lokufa kwakhe, zonke izinsuku zokuhamba kwakhe.",
          "type": "text",
